        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Martin Degville, Richie Furay, Stephen Stills, Neil Young, Bruce Palmer, Dewey Martin, Jim Messina, Rusty Young, George Grantham, Randy Meisner\n- Bands: Sigue Sigue Sputnik, Buffalo Springfield, Poco\n- Places: Walsall\n- Roles: Lead singer, co-songwriter, singer, songwriter\n- Songs: \"Love Missile F1-11\"\n- Organizations: Rock & Roll Hall of Fame, EMI\n\nFacts:\n- Richie Furay was born on May 9, 1944.\n- Martin Degville was born on January 27, 1961, in Walsall.\n- Richie Furay is an American singer, songwriter, and Rock & Roll Hall of Fame member.\n- Richie Furay is best known for forming Buffalo Springfield with Stephen Stills, Neil Young, Bruce Palmer, and Dewey Martin.\n- Richie Furay is also best known for forming Poco with Jim Messina, Rusty Young, George Grantham, and Randy Meisner.\n- Martin Degville is the lead singer and co-songwriter of the UK pop band Sigue Sigue Sputnik.\n- Sigue Sigue Sputnik had a worldwide hit single in 1986 with \"Love Missile F1-11\".\n- Sigue Sigue Sputnik had six other EMI single releases.",
